--- a child cannot change its parent's memory
mutated 999 4 100
parent: shared 10, table 3 1
--- a child that runs out of memory ends alone
memory hog: kind 2 out of memory, still alive: 2
--- a child that overflows its stack ends alone
stack hog: kind 2 stack overflow
--- messages are copies, in order, and bounded
send 10000 bytes: 0
got 10000
50 messages answered in order: true
a message over 1 MiB: -90
a message of exactly 1 MiB: 0
a negative tag: -22
to a pid that never existed: -3
mailbox of a busy process: accepted 1000, then error -105, waiting 1000
--- a pid is not reused by mistake
old pid dead: true, new alive: true, different: true
send to the old pid: -3
--- a conversation
1000 round trips: 1000
--- the first process cannot be killed
kill 1: -1
end: 1
